OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 8 JAN
OL,4,G0630FBreakfast
OL,5,     GTom McKinney presents Radio 3's
OL,6,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,7,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,8,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,9,     GIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,10,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,11,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,12,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,13,G1300FClassical Live
OL,14,     GAlfred Brendel plays Beethoven's
OL,15,     G4th Piano Concerto in an archive
OL,16,     Grecording from Munich, plus
OL,17,     GElgar's Enigma Variations from
OL,18,     Gthe BBC National Orchestra of
OL,19,     GWales.
