OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 8 JAN
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Copland
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod examines Copland's
OL,6,     Gclosest collaborations - and his
OL,7,     Gpolitical controversies.
OL,8,G1700FIn Tune
OL,9,     GMezzo-soprano Katie Bray is
OL,10,     Gjoined by pianist Will Van to
OL,11,     Gperform from and talk about her
OL,12,     Gnew Kurt Weill album as well as
OL,13,     Gviolin & piano duo Elena Urioste
OL,14,     G& Tom Poster.
OL,15,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,16,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,17,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
