OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 8 JAN
OL,4,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,5,     GBBC Radio 3 is taking listeners
OL,6,     Gon a coast-to-coast musical
OL,7,     Gjourney across the United States,
OL,8,     Gas 2026 marks 250 years since the
OL,9,     Gsigning of the Declaration of
OL,10,     GIndependence.
OL,11,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,12,     GFrench pianist Alexandre Tharaud
OL,13,     Gdisplays his wide repertoire in
OL,14,     Gthis concert from Barcelona.
OL,15,     GStarting with Bach, he moves on
OL,16,     Gto Ravel, and Dukas' The
OL,17,     GSorceror's Apprentice.
